{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRIVE HOME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your buddies are on your way home from a relaxing vacation but are forced to take an alternate route. Get your RV through the back country and find the exit to Route 65.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949040/extras/74f633e140b7d070a49d7c167641edfa.poster.avif?t=1760218774\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949040/extras/74f633e140b7d070a49d7c167641edfa.webm?t=1760218774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE MABUTTS VALLEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Not everyone who enters Mabutts Valley makes it out alive. So be sure to keep a steady flow of burgers, antidotes, and the classic: EpiPens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949040/extras/83fde7ea8c5d325686a66d281ee91814.poster.avif?t=1760218774\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949040/extras/83fde7ea8c5d325686a66d281ee91814.webm?t=1760218774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WINCH IT GOOD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the physics based winch and earn the right to be the main remote commander. With a winch front and rear, your RV is especially equipped to get over, under or through most road bumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949040/extras/738101674cc7488c3af920332b227a96.poster.avif?t=1760218774\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949040/extras/738101674cc7488c3af920332b227a96.webm?t=1760218774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HELP YOURSELF, AND EACH OTHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help yourself to cold brewskis and filtered low tar cigarettes, but don\u2019t forget that the driver will have a hard time completing this journey alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949040/extras/ba95eb68f7f03f3d1e35ebe5185f61f3.poster.avif?t=1760218774\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949040/extras/ba95eb68f7f03f3d1e35ebe5185f61f3.webm?t=1760218774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A SCRAPPY BUNCH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everything you find to maintain the integrity of your RV and friendships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949040/extras/5b2a6e1629cf3e47c1e516414791e002.poster.avif?t=1760218774\" w